//MCQ

::Spark SQL Purpose::
What is the primary purpose of Spark SQL?
{
    ~ To replace Spark Core completely
    = To process structured and semi-structured data using SQL and DataFrame APIs
    ~ To manage Hadoop clusters
    ~ To store data in HDFS
}

::Catalyst Optimizer::
What is the role of the Catalyst Optimizer in Spark SQL?
{
    ~ To store cached data in memory
    = To optimize logical and physical query execution plans
    ~ To convert RDDs into DataFrames
    ~ To manage Spark cluster resources
}

::SparkSession::
Which object is required to run SQL queries in Spark?
{
    ~ SparkContext
    = SparkSession
    ~ SQLContext (mandatory in Spark 3.x)
    ~ Executor
}
